{"id":102812853871831,"name":"SURVIVE PURSUER (Die of Death)","desc":"Survive The Pursuer.\n\nVersion: v3.5\n\nYou didn’t exactly choose this place. Life just kind of dropped you here, and now you’re stuck in a forest that was never really yours. Something else lives here, and when night falls, it wakes up hungry. It hunts, it kills, and somehow it always knows where to look. So yeah, no pressure. Grab whatever weapon you can find, try not to trip over a root, and maybe don’t breathe too loud. Your only job is to stay alive long enough to take it down first. Think you can survive the pursuer, or are you about to become part of the wildlife?\n\nCan you survive the pursuer?\n\nPlease always note that the game is in a very early stage and finding bugs might be undifficult.\n\nThis game is more recommended to play in computer\n\nSaucefy10 Made Die of Death.\nInspired by The Rake Remastered by RVVZ.","path":"/game/102812853871831-survive-pursuer","slug":"102812853871831-survive-pursuer","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/95cd227eb33368f3156cec214a5ca43804987aff83cb781e902bf120ef07cb4e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8a39ce6f53aa42ea1b138de382773d55/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":576728,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-14T12:06:01.010Z","creator":{"name":"Crintar","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"68ee3ca962724ec96c5561a0","title":"Many Features","game":{"_id":"68e69456e32886b2ab28c610","gameId":102812853871831,"name":"SURVIVE PURSUER (Die of Death)","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6fc88acb7f8000d91a21aa1715a95fcf4ea140c4377e44017b632df73582a314.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-358a1f623d7d7efae46d814024ccf9e0-4bed6972e7a5.png"},"slug":"102812853871831-survive-pursuer","path":"/game/102812853871831-survive-pursuer","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6fc88acb7f8000d91a21aa